{
 "9601": {
  "en": [
   "I have brought the new spring's basket of gifts to your door,",
   "come, come, come,",
   "you will wear it as a garland at your throat.",
   "Losing the vine's binding, the madhabi dies weeping--",
   "you will keep her bound in the binding of your braid,",
   "you will swing her on your swaying tresses,",
   "come, come, come.",
   "You will steal the forest's sweetness",
   "into your own fresh sweetness--",
   "it will waken the Sohini melody in you,",
   "on every string of the body's veena,",
   "come, come, come."
  ],
