 "9603": {
  "en": [
   "Curds, anyone -- curds, who wants curds?",
   "Shyamali is my cow,",
   "she has no equal.",
   "To the bank of the Kankana river",
   "I take her at daybreak--",
   "in the meadow thick with durba grass",
   "I graze her all day long, graze her.",
   "Her body is sleek and black,",
   "the more I look, the more it pleases me.",
   "I sit close by and scold her,",
   "she answers with her eyes,",
   "she lays her head on my back--",
   "I stroke her body with my hand, stroke her with my hand."
