 "9605": {
  "en": [
   "O all you girls of the neighborhood,",
   "come, come, look and see,",
   "I have brought a pair of bangles",
   "wound with golden wire.",
   "Listen to my words,",
   "take them, wear them on your hands,",
   "whomever you wish to hold and keep,",
   "these two bangles, turning to fetters,",
   "will bind his heart--",
   "I have said it."
