 "9606": {
  "en": [
   "The one who sent me into this",
   "darkness of humiliation--",
   "I will not worship, will not worship that god, I will not worship.",
   "Why should I give flowers, why should I give flowers,",
   "why should I give flowers to him--",
   "who for my whole life",
   "kept me in this contempt.",
   "I do not know, alas, in what vain hope",
   "I light the worship-lamp at the temple door.",
   "Its light he stole away,",
   "the god, by deceit,",
   "and kept me in the dark."
  ],
