   "the day drifts by, the day drifts by.",
   "There in the palace the bell tolls dong dong dong dong dong dong,",
   "the day drifts by.",
   "The sun has grown fierce and sharp,",
   "the courtyard has not been swabbed clean,",
   "the water has not been drawn,",
   "the fruit has not been picked,",
   "when will you light the stove?",
   "When will you graze the goat?",
   "Hurry, hurry, hurry--",
   "draw the water and go home.",
   "There in the palace the bell tolls,",
