 "9613": {
  "en": [
   "The earth has called you -- come along,",
   "come, come, come.",
   "Her basket has filled today with ripened harvest--",
   "I could die -- ah, ah, ah.",
   "Drunk on the wind, they rose in revel--",
   "the brides of the horizon in the harvest fields;",
   "the gold of sunlight spills on the earth's sari-hem--",
   "I could die -- ah, ah, ah.",
   "Hearing and hearing the flute of the fields, the sky grew glad.",
   "Who will stay home today? Open the doors, open.",
   "The laughter of light has wakened,",
   "a shimmer strikes leaf upon leaf--",
   "the forest's joy cannot be held -- see it brimming over--",
   "I could die -- ah, ah, ah."
