 "9614": {
  "en": [
   "Oh, do not call me, do not call.",
   "My work-forgetting mind is somewhere far away--",
   "practicing its worship of dreams.",
   "The unheld shadow will not be caught,",
   "it has woven a bewitching illusion in the mind--",
   "I do not know if this is some god's mercy,",
   "I do not know if it is deception.",
   "I have lit no lamp in the dark courtyard,",
   "I am the garland-maker of a burnt garden,",
   "empty-handed, a beggar woman,",
   "I pass my nights and days.",
   "If he comes, in the shadow of his feet",
   "I will spread out my pain,",
   "and tell him the tear-drenched",
   "longing of an empty life."
  ],
