 "9623": {
  "en": [
   "He says, give water, give water.",
   "I shall give -- who gave me such means?",
   "Gazing toward the black cloud",
   "comes rushing",
   "the chatak bird, distraught--",
   "it says, give water.",
   "Lost beneath the ground,",
   "the spring's stream",
   "in the darkness,",
   "in its prison.",
   "Whose deep-sounding word",
