   "He is my wayfarer,",
   "the wayfarer of my heart's road.",
   "Alas, he came no more, he came no more,",
   "he came no more along this road,",
   "and he asked no more for water.",
   "So my heart became a desert,",
   "its sap dried away--",
   "he asked not for water."
