 "9625": {
  "en": [
   "Thirst is in my eyes,",
   "thirst across all my breast.",
   "I am a rainless day of Baishakh,",
   "my heart burns away in anguish.",
   "A storm has risen on the hot winds,",
   "it drives the mind into the far void--",
   "my veil goes flying away.",
   "The flower that lit the grove",
   "has turned black and withered.",
   "Who barred the waterfall's way--",
   "bound in cruel stone",
   "on sorrow's summit peak."
